cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MetaboCast, please cite the software and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "MetaboCast: predicting spatial metabolite maps from spatial transcriptomics with per-ion reliability"
abstract: "MetaboCast learns from paired mass-spectrometry imaging and spatial transcriptomics to predict metabolite ion maps for transcriptome-only sections. Principal components of gene expression and copies diffused over the spot graph feed an ensemble of ridge regression and extremely randomized trees trained on section-wise rank-normalised ion intensities. Every predicted ion carries an empirical uncertainty width, its accuracy within sections and on unseen sections, a reliability tier that separates the two, and putative exact-mass candidates."
